<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Comparison of Real-User Data and Pre-SFT LLMs’ Investment Decision on <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{P_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖯</mi><mn>𝟣</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{P_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{P_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖯</mi><mn>𝟣</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{P_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>Statistical Tests’ Results of the Differences and Correlation Coefficients</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Probability Distribution Function of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{A_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖠</mi><mn>𝟣</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{A_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>’s Optimal Investment Decision of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{P_{3}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖯</mi><mn>𝟥</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{P_{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS8" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.8 </span>Gradient Norms of the Loss Function</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS9" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9 </span>The Ablation Study on the Hyper-parameters of SFT</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS10" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.10 </span>The Experimental Results of Supplementing Smaller Samples of Real-user Data with Theoretical Solutions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS11" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.11 </span>The Experimental Results of Compare <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">InvestAgent</span>s with LLMs Fine-tuned Using the Baseline FinGPT Dataset</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS12" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12 </span>The Experimental Results of Validating that <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">InvestAgent</span>s Better Reflect Economic Principles in the Presence of Investor Herd Behavior Compared to Pre-SFT LLMs</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS12.SSS1" title="In A.12 The Experimental Results of Validating that InvestAgents Better Reflect Economic Principles in the Presence of Investor Herd Behavior Compared to Pre-SFT LLMs ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12.1 </span>Experimental Setup</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS12.SSS2" title="In A.12 The Experimental Results of Validating that InvestAgents Better Reflect Economic Principles in the Presence of Investor Herd Behavior Compared to Pre-SFT LLMs ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12.2 </span>Validation of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{H_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖧</mi><mn>𝟣</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{H_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS12.SSS3" title="In A.12 The Experimental Results of Validating that InvestAgents Better Reflect Economic Principles in the Presence of Investor Herd Behavior Compared to Pre-SFT LLMs ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.12.3 </span>Validation of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{H_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖧</mi><mn>𝟤</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{H_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS13" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.13 </span>Prompts</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS14" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.14 </span>Questionnaires</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
