<figure id="A1.F6.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2507.06528v1/training_loss_glm.svg" id="A1.F6.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:167/125;" width="167" height="125"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span>Figure <a href="#S4.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ 4.2 Analysis of Parameter Convergence Rates ‣ 4 Methodology: InvestAlign ‣ InvestAlign: Overcoming Data Scarcity in Aligning Large Language Models with Investor Decision-Making Processes under Herd Behavior" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a></figcaption>
