<td id="A1.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:43.8pt;padding-right:43.8pt;">     <span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen-2</span>     </td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:43.8pt;padding-right:43.8pt;">     <span id="A1.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Llama-3.1</span>     </td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:43.8pt;padding-right:43.8pt;" colspan="3">     <math id="A1.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{P_{3}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝖯</mi><mn>𝟥</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{P_{3}}</annotation></semantics></math>: Absolute herd behavior with unilateral influence (simple problem)     </td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
